@startuml
!theme plain
title Module-specific Action Processing (gw:act-per-module)

actor "Maven" as Maven
participant "ActPerModuleMojo" as Mojo
participant "ActProcessor" as Processor
participant "AI Engine" as AI
participant "User" as User

== For Each Module in Reactor Order ==

Maven -> Mojo: execute() for Module N
activate Mojo

== Eligibility Check ==

Mojo -> Mojo: Check if module\nshould be processed
note right: Process if:\n- Is execution root OR\n- Non-recursive mode is false

alt Module not eligible
    Mojo -> Mojo: Log "skip scanning modules"
    Mojo --> Maven: Skip this module
else Module eligible
    
    == Action Resolution (Once per Build) ==
    
    alt Act not in session
        Mojo -> User: Prompt for action\n(synchronized)
        User --> Mojo: Enter act name or\ndirect prompt (>...)
        Mojo -> Mojo: Save act in session
    else Act already in session
        Mojo -> Mojo: Reuse saved act
    end
    
    == Processor Setup ==
    
    Mojo -> Processor: Create processor\n(rooted at execution root)
    activate Processor
    
    Mojo -> Processor: Override processModule()\n(no-op)
    note right: Prevents processor from\ntraversing child modules
    
    alt Maven project exists
        Mojo -> Mojo: Register class\nintrospection tools
    end
    
    == Action Execution ==
    
    Mojo -> Processor: Force non-recursive mode
    note right: Each module processed\nin isolation
    
    Mojo -> Mojo: Apply acts location\nand exclusions
    
    Mojo -> Processor: Execute action\non current module only
    
    Processor -> AI: Apply action\nto module files
    AI --> Processor: Generate changes
    
    Processor --> Mojo: Module complete
    
    == Completion ==
    
    alt Exit code = 0
        Mojo -> Mojo: Normal completion
    else Exit code != 0
        Mojo -> Mojo: Throw termination error
    end
    
    Mojo -> Mojo: Log statistics
    
    deactivate Processor
end

Mojo --> Maven: Module complete
deactivate Mojo

Maven -> Maven: Continue with\nnext module

@enduml